{"id":"76afa90dfcbc1c79","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-semistable.md","title":"Semistable","display":"df-semistable — Semistable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-semistable","aliases":["58-df-semistable","Semistable"],"display":"df-semistable — Semistable","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-slope.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-semistable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-semistable</span><span>Semistable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-semistable — Semistable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df6e75b9887b02cd\" href=\"?note=df6e75b9887b02cd\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-slope.md\">../batch11/58-df-slope.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X\\in V\">\\(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X\\in V\\)</span> (sheaf code, curve, topology, and structure sheaf)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mu,S}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mu,S}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (slope-semistability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df6e75b9887b02cd\" href=\"?note=df6e75b9887b02cd\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-slope.md\">../batch11/58-df-slope.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SemistableStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SemistableStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Semistable}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Semistable}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semistable\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{SemistableStructure}_S(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mu,S}(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semistable\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{SemistableStructure}_S(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mu,S}(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semistable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Semistable}_S(E,X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X\\;\\mathrm{SemistableStructure}_S(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semistable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Semistable}_S(E,X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X\\;\\mathrm{SemistableStructure}_S(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The structure-level predicate retains the topology and structure sheaf required by the upstream definition; the two-place predicate is only its existential projection.</li>\n<li>Semistability: no proper positive-rank coherent subsheaf has larger slope; central to GIT and moduli theory</li>\n<li>Mumford: semistability via GIT quotient; GIT quotient exists for semistable points</li>\n<li>Jordan-Hölder: semistable sheaf has filtration with stable quotients of equal slope</li>\n<li>Moduli space: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(r, d)\">\\(M(r, d)\\)</span> of semistable bundles of rank <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>, degree <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> on curve <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span></li>\n<li>Higgs bundles: semistable principal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-Higgs bundle correspond to representations</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Huybrechts and Lehn, The Geometry of Moduli Spaces of Sheaves</li>\n<li>Seshadri, Quotient Spaces</li>\n<li>Donaldson, Kronheimer, Geometry of Four-Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-slope.md","status":"resolved","id":"df6e75b9887b02cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-slope.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-slope.md","status":"resolved","id":"df6e75b9887b02cd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mu,S}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (slope-semistability predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-slope.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mu,S}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SemistableStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Semistable}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semistable\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{SemistableStructure}_S(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mu,S}(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semistable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Semistable}_S(E,X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X\\;\\mathrm{SemistableStructure}_S(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)","display":true},{"tex":"M(r, d)","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1793,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-semistable.md|58-df-semistable]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["df6e75b9887b02cd"]}